<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>出版物 |皮尤研究中心</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/publications/</link><description>塑造您世界的数字、事实和趋势</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 03:26:30 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>伊朗冲突仍然极不受欢迎，因为许多美国人预计冲突将持续数月</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/08/iran-conflict-remains-deeply-unpopular-as-many-americans-expect-it-to-go-on-for-months/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/SR_26.10.08_iran_featured-image.jpg?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;大约三分之二 (65%) 的人现在不赞成唐纳德·特朗普总统处理美国在伊朗的军事行动的方式，而三分之一 (33%) 的人则表示赞同。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 03:26:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/08/iran-conflict-remains-deeply-unpopular-as-many-americans-expect-it-to-go-on-for-months/</guid></item><item><title>随着公众的经济评级变得更加负面，成本担忧占据主导地位</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/10/08/cost-concerns-dominate-as-publics-economic-ratings-turn-more-negative/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/PP_2026.10.8_economy_crop.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;许多家庭必需品的成本是大多数美国人最关心的经济问题 — — 就像四年前上一次中期选举前夕一样。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 03:26:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/10/08/cost-concerns-dominate-as-publics-economic-ratings-turn-more-negative/</guid></item><item><title>由于美国人心情不好，民主党选民更加积极地参与中期选举</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/10/08/with-americans-in-a-sour-mood-democratic-voters-are-more-engaged-in-midterms/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/PP_2026.10.8_midterms_crop.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt; 2026 年中期选举正值公众对国家现状深感不满，特朗普的支持率接近历史最低水平。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 03:26:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/10/08/with-americans-in-a-sour-mood-democratic-voters-are-more-engaged-in-midterms/</guid></item><item><title>美国人如何参与在线新闻？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/07/how-do-americans-engage-with-news-online/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/SR_26.10.07_online-engagement_topic.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;大多数美国人在网上私下谈论新闻，但只有大约四分之一的人公开发布新闻。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 03:20:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/07/how-do-americans-engage-with-news-online/</guid></item><item><title>健康和保健影响者发布的内容是什么？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/data-labs/2026/10/07/what-do-health-and-wellness-influencers-post-about/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/pl_2026.10.07_health-influencers-featured-image.jpg?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;社交媒体上超过一半的健康内容关注健康生活，约三分之一讨论医疗话题。 38% 的帖子有产品或服务促销。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 03:20:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/data-labs/2026/10/07/what-do-health-and-wellness-influencers-post-about/</guid></item></channel></rss>